<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech April jobless 3.8 pct vs 3.9 pct in March.</title>
<headline>Czech April jobless 3.8 pct vs 3.9 pct in March.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unemployment in the Czech Republic in April fell to 3.8 percent in April from 3.9 percent in March, the Czech Labour and Social Affairs Ministry said on Monday.  </p>
<p> CZECH UNEMPLOYMENT	APRIL 1997   MARCH 1997  APRIL 1996</p>
<p> total jobless		195,023     199,597     148,727</p>
<p> percentage of workforce   3.8	    3.9	  2.8</p>
<p>NOTE: Measures through end of period listed.</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
